        <mxCell id="v2-37" edge="1" parent="1" source="v2-12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.83;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="v2-23" value="S3 (free, private)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="1" y="-52" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="23" y="-5" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v2-38" edge="1" parent="1" source="v2-23" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="v2-26" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v2-39" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Target architecture v2 (draft).&lt;/b&gt; Built in stages. &lt;b&gt;L3 (done):&lt;/b&gt; VPC, 6 subnets, routes, NAT, S3 endpoint, 4 security groups, bastion. &lt;b&gt;L4:&lt;/b&gt; ALB + Auto Scaling Group (min 2, one per AZ); each instance runs nginx + Node.js from an S3 artifact (Launch Template, user_data, systemd). &lt;b&gt;L5:&lt;/b&gt; RDS PostgreSQL (private, automated backups, restore demo) + artists&#39; images on S3. &lt;b&gt;L6:&lt;/b&gt; CloudWatch, tighter security groups, secrets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrow colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = customer traffic (Internet, IGW, ALB, instances) | red = admin SSH (your IP only, enters through the Internet Gateway, bastion, then the instance) | grey = outbound through the NAT | purple = S3.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Traffic:&lt;/b&gt; Internet to ALB :80, to nginx :80, to Node :3001 (one origin, no CORS). App tier outbound through the NAT (dnf/npm). S3 through the free gateway endpoint.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security groups:&lt;/b&gt; alb-sg (80/443 from Internet) | bastion-sg (22 from admin IP /32) | app-sg (80 from alb-sg, 22 from bastion-sg) | db-sg (5432 from app-sg only).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lifecycle:&lt;/b&gt; destroyed every session (destroy.sh): everything in the VPC, ALB, ASG, RDS. Persistent (bootstrap/): the two S3 buckets, not billed by the hour.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open decisions:&lt;/b&gt; RDS Multi-AZ (optional, doubles RDS hours) | CloudFront (optional) | HTTPS (needs a certificate: check the lab) | secrets mechanism (confirm with the professor)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="1480" x="-365" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
